# Conformance probe pack for `group <list> fx` and `group <list> more` outside
# any `if` or `opt` block (spec 0.8), most significant bit first. Public. No
# kinds. Each list has at least one item on the wire; an absent or empty list
# is `transform-encode`.
#
#   nums        each item: val in 7 bits, then one bit, 1 = another follows
#   recs        each item: one bit, 1 = another follows this one, then x in 7 bits
format     conformance-seq-groups-bare
version    0.8.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.nums fx
  field  probe.val  7  uint
end
group   probe.recs more
  field  probe.x  7  uint
end
